     1	# Moriarty consolidated roadmap
     2	
     3	Moriarty is a permissionless language of provable financial intention, compiled to Midnight ZKIRv3. The optional Federated DeFi Kernel coordinates solvers, evidence and multichain execution under those intentions. The [consolidated vision and design](docs/MORIARTY-CONSOLIDATED-DESIGN.md) defines that boundary; the [product contract](docs/MORIARTY-PRODUCT-CONTRACT.md) preserves the user's controlling constraints.
     4	
     5	This is the **single delivery sequence**. P0–P7, C0–C4 and K0–K5 are retained requirement/provenance aliases, not parallel work queues. MC01–MC08, SP01–SP12 and G01–G24 retain their objective acceptance obligations. [Traceability and conflict dispositions](openspec/changes/consolidated-language-kernel/traceability.md) map the inherited work without resetting evidence, resource charges or unresolved failures.
     6	
     7	## What exists
     8	
     9	Local source/5 lifecycle evaluation, finite [K comparisons](deliverables/k-lifecycle-execution-2026-09-17/RESULT.md), and scoped Preview [loan](deliverables/preview-loan-2026-09-17/recovery-run01/RESULT.md) and [swap](deliverables/sp05-financial-integration-2026-09-09/preview-swap-exit-01/RESULT.md) results are foundations. The [whole-language audit](deliverables/whole-language-review-2026-09-19/REVIEW.md) identifies the missing integrated rich-source/intent/target path, recovery and lifetime-state issues. The [DeFiFormal study](deliverables/defiformal-study-2026-09-19/RESULT.md) supplies semantic reference contracts, not a deployed federation or transferable native proof.
    10	
    11	General source-to-ledger correspondence, mandatory native proof-carrying acceptance across the full supported language, recursive/private history, federated integrations and complete conformance remain open. All U milestones below are specified-only until their exact exits are demonstrated. Documentation and advisor agreement do not complete them.
    12	
    13	## Recursion planning horizon
    14	
